@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ORDINARY_CSP_ADMIN_TOKEN
@key = REPLACE_WITH_STABLE_CREATION_KEY
@tenantId = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_TENANT_ID
@operationId = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_OPERATION_ID
@directoryTenantId = REPLACE_WITH_EXPLICIT_DIRECTORY_TENANT_ID
@objectId = REPLACE_WITH_EXPLICIT_USER_OBJECT_ID

### Confirmed creation is atomic; initialAdministrator is optional (omitted means deferred).
### Exactly one of personId or newPerson is accepted. Contact fields never grant access.
### Changed intent with the same key is rejected. Existing pre-extension create replays remain valid.
### Limits: displayName 200; legalEntityName 300; primaryPocName 200; primaryPocEmail 254.
### newPerson displayName/email: 256/320. Explicit directory/object IDs must be nonempty GUIDs.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/dashboard/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: csp
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Mission organization",
  "legalEntityName": "Mission legal entity",
  "primaryPocName": "Organization contact",
  "primaryPocEmail": "contact@example.invalid",
  "initialAdministrator": {
    "directoryTenantId": "{{directoryTenantId}}",
    "objectId": "{{objectId}}",
    "newPerson": {
      "displayName": "Initial administrator",
      "email": "administrator@example.invalid"
    }
  }
}

### Read-only lost-response recovery. Same create data shape; missing key is
### 404 ORGANIZATION_CREATION_NOT_FOUND. Never infer a missing record from permission/network errors.
### Persisted operation with a missing organization is 409, not a new-creation opportunity.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/organization-creations/{{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: csp
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary

### Existing provisioning fields plus initialAdministrator, personState, canEditAdministrator.
### Intent is editable before binding only. New Person and binding/audit commit atomically.
### personState: NotRequested for deferred/existing Person, Pending/Completed for new Person.
### overallState remains InProgress/Failed/Completed. Deferred setup is not complete.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/organizations/{{tenantId}}/provisioning/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: csp
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary

### Resume with persisted administrator intent, or correct an unbound intent.
### Resend data.initialAdministrator unchanged, including after refresh or partial failure.
### In newPerson mode its personId remains null even after the generated Person is saved.
### The generated binding is internal; do not add a personId alongside newPerson.
### Legacy {directoryTenantId,objectId,personId} remains valid for a target-local Person.
### Execution: optional local Person -> membership -> Organization Administrator.
### No email-to-identity inference, directory promotion, system grants, subscriptions or ATO writes.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/organizations/{{tenantId}}/provisioning/{{operationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: csp
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "directoryTenantId": "{{directoryTenantId}}",
  "objectId": "{{objectId}}",
  "newPerson": {
    "displayName": "Initial administrator",
    "email": "administrator@example.invalid"
  }
}

### List/detail: setupState Pending/Completed/Failed/NotStarted and active memberCount.
### Detail also includes persisted legalEntityName, primaryPocName, primaryPocEmail.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/organizations/{{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: csp
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary
